SUMMARY:Evening Discussion and Dinner!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nEnjoy dinner and discussion at 
 Indian Curry Lounge with us\, 6:00pm\, Saturday June 20th!\n\nYou may reme
 mber this Indian restaurant location was previously known as Namaste\, and
  before that Tulsi. It is built into the first floor of the motel building
 \, it is two doors down from El Serranos\, where we meet for our other mon
 thly evening meeting!\n\nIndian Curry Lounge\n2101 Columbia Avenue\nLancas
 ter PA 17603
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 314836958/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260517T224421Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T224421Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
